8fiNxtKWAxUZn68BHYzsIwwQ3YcHCLsBKAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjC8fiNxtKWAxUZn68BHYzsIwwQ3IcHCLoBKAQ",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjC8fiNxtKWAxUZn68BHYzsIwwQ3IcHCLwBKAU",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjC8fiNxtKWAxUZn68BHYzsIwwQ3IcHCL0BKAY",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjC8fiNxtKWAxUZn68BHYzsIwwQ3IcHCL4BKAc",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjC8fiNxtKWAxUZn68BHYzsIwwQ3YcHCMABKAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwjC8fiNxtKWAxUZn68BHYzsIwwQ3IcHCL8BKAg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["當天造訪**北海道炙燒拉麵**，整體體驗真的超出期待，必須給五星好評！一走進店裡就能聞到濃郁卻不膩的湯頭香氣，讓人瞬間食慾大開。店內環境乾淨明亮，座位安排舒適，用餐氛圍輕鬆不壓迫，無論是自己來吃或跟朋友聚餐都很適合。\n\n這次點了招牌炙燒拉麵，湯頭濃厚卻不死鹹，喝得出長時間熬煮的層次感。炙燒過的叉燒油脂香氣十足，表面微微焦香、內裡依然軟嫩多汁，搭配彈牙的麵條真的非常加分，每一口都很滿足。配料份量也給得很有誠意，吃完有飽足感卻不會覺得負擔。\n\n另外服務人員態度親切，點餐與上菜速度都很順，遇到問題也會耐心解說，讓人感覺相當用心。整體來說，不論是口味、品質還是服務，都能感受到店家的用心經營。如果你是拉麵控，或是想找一家穩定又好吃的拉麵店，這間真的非常值得再訪與推薦。",null,[0,108]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14463834428194006828/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF2TVdKV1RsRlNXRnBFWlVkV1YySXpUakJYVldodFZGWlNaazR4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14463834428194006828/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF2TVdKV1RsRlNXRnBFWlVkV1YySXpUakJYVldodFZGWlNaazR4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14463834428194006828/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF2TVdKV1RsRlNXRnBFWlVkV1YySXpUakJYVldodFZGWlNaazR4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14463834428194006828/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF2TVdKV